WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:05.210
Meet the Varn command center, our prototype for exploring the whole planet.

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:07.820
Spin the globe.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:09.080
Pick any city.

00:00:09.610 --> 00:00:13.190
Then dive from orbit to street level in seconds.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:18.050
Buildings rise in 3D, block by block.

00:00:19.560 --> 00:00:24.530
Layer in satellite clouds, rainfall, and recent earthquakes from around the world.

00:00:26.060 --> 00:00:27.660
One interactive view of the Earth.

NOTE The words spoken at the very end (about 28.3 to 31.7 seconds) are not captioned yet. Add them here once confirmed.
